    "File Search reads your disk directly to build a private index on this Mac. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access, turn on Ministart. If it isn’t listed, click + and choose Ministart from Applications. If access still shows as required, quit and reopen Ministart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
